  "text": "Hello all — I'd like to set up our CSE455 staff meeting for next week.\n\nLooking at my calendar, the free slots are:\n- Tuesday 11:00-11:30\n- Wednesday 13:00-13:30\n\nDoes either work for you? If both clash, tell me what your week looks like and I'll find something else.",
