  "text": "Wednesday 13:00-13:30 works for me — I'm free then, and it ends right as the CSE455 quiz section starts at 13:30.\n\nTuesday 11:00-11:30 doesn't work: I have lunch 11:10-12:10, so it would cut into that. Wednesday it is from my side, unless someone clashes.",
