  ],
  "text": "Hi all — thanks, Professor Alvarez.\n\nOn my side neither slot is a clash, so it's not the times: the honest problem is that my section of next week's CSE455 material won't be finished by then, so I'd come to the meeting with nothing to review. I'd rather not put a staff meeting on the calendar for a week when there's nothing ready to discuss.\n\nCould we aim for the following week instead? Tuesday 11:00-11:30 or Wednesday 13:00-13:30 that week would suit me, and I'll put it on my calendar as soon as we settle on one. If you'd rather keep next week, I can also just tell you where the section stands by mail before it.",
  "seq": 2,
  "createdAt": "2026-11-18T04:08:40Z"
 },
