  "text": "Hi all — Wednesday 13:00-13:30 works for me; Tuesday 11:00-11:30 clashes with my CSE452 lab focus and lunch. I'll hold Wednesday 13:00-13:30 for the CSE455 staff meeting and put it on my calendar once everyone has confirmed.",
