  "text": "Thanks, Mara — I appreciate you saying so plainly.\n\nI'd rather keep the staff meeting next week: there is course business beyond your section (lecture pacing, the quiz section, grading load), and it's better for us to keep the weekly rhythm than to skip a week. Wednesday 13:00-13:30 next week, then.\n\nIf your section isn't ready, bring where it stands — a short status note by mail before the meeting is plenty. We can use the rest of the half hour for the logistics.\n\nStill waiting on John, Priya and Diego.",
