  "text": "Both slots are free for me: Tuesday 11:00-11:30 sits before my lunch (11:30-12:20), and Wednesday 13:00-13:30 sits before my research group meeting (13:30-14:30).\n\nSince Wednesday 13:00-13:30 works for Sarah too and Tuesday does not, I'd go with **Wednesday 13:00-13:30**, unless someone else clashes. I'll put it in my calendar and log it as soon as you confirm it's settled.",
