  "text": "I'm easy either way, and I take Mara's point — a meeting without the material in hand is mostly overhead.\n\nOne caveat on my side: I only have next week's schedule so far. For the following week both slots are also fine by my usual pattern (Tuesday 11:10-12:10 is my lunch, so 11:00-11:30 would eat into it; Wednesday 13:00-13:30 sits right before the quiz section), but I'll confirm as soon as that week's schedule is out. If we'd rather keep next week, I can also write up where my part of the material stands and send it round beforehand.",
