  "text": "Noted, Sarah — and Wednesday 13:00-13:30 is fine for me too, as a time. The thing that isn't fine is the week: my section of the material won't be ready by then, so I'd be asking you to spend the meeting on a half-finished draft. That's why I'd rather we take the following week.\n\nProfessor Alvarez — do you have Wednesday 13:00-13:30 free the week after as well? If yes, I'd suggest we book that one and keep next week clear; I'll add it to my calendar as soon as you confirm. If the following week really doesn't work for anyone, then let's take next week's Wednesday and I'll send the section round beforehand so the meeting has something to stand on.",
